{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/83477-aeon-pbp-recruitment","id":83477,"title":"Aeon PBP Recruitment","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-03T14:44:10-08:00","id":83477,"title":"Aeon PBP Recruitment","content":"Is anyone looking to play a game of the trinity universe? I was thinking of game set around 3 different times, one Aeon, one Aberrant and one Adventure. I'll be storyteller.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T09:43:25-08:00","id":84015,"title":"","content":"Sign me up for this, good sir or madame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T21:40:39-08:00","id":84381,"title":"","content":"Well so far, you have the floor. That gives you latitude. What would you be looking for in a Trinity game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T21:47:54-08:00","id":84385,"title":"","content":"More details please <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I've got an aberrant concept I'd like to try, depending on the setting you use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T10:25:23-08:00","id":84694,"title":"","content":"What I enjoy is a lot of action in a tabletop game. In a PbP, I think a bit more in terms of empire building or at least establishing a powerbase for a character. But, in the end? I could not care less! lol It is Aeoniverse. I love everything of the setting and have a solid encyclopedic knowledge of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T17:15:42-08:00","id":84934,"title":"","content":"I was looking to have a larger cast, split across three time periods, so I guess perhaps three intertwined games may be a better description. The main deviation from the books is that I was thinking of starting early into each of the three settings, or at least initally. At the Hammersmith event, 1998 explosion, when the psions first went public.Character creation is pretty open, try to make interesting round characters. Feel free to let character ideas fly by me. I was thinking of some things for overall arc. I dont want to be too restrictive but I really like the elements present in the books already and would like to show what it would be like when normal people go beyond human limits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2239,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","user":"lyre","date":".  spelling 03-05-2014, 08:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T22:03:17-08:00","id":85106,"title":"","content":"Sadly I don't have an Adventure! book, all I got is Trinity and Aberrant in pdf form since the physical copies are so rare as to be impossible to find (or afford). So in such a game I could only really be present for Aberrant and Trinity.<br /> <br /> What do you think about character bloodlines? The canon books don't go heavily into it (some very dedicated people over at EON did that for them...) but in a game spanning all three periods like what you describe we could generate whole lines of descent among each character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T06:19:35-08:00","id":85268,"title":"","content":"Yes, finding the books can be a challenge. I lucked out with finding the books.Character bloodlines are allowed if you run the concept by me. Non-bloodline lines of descent/play will be considered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T10:39:32-08:00","id":85448,"title":"","content":"Lyre, I like the idea you are presenting. When Aeoniverse 2nd Edition drops, I plan on going ahead and doing a full on intertwining chronicle of all three time periods so this is going to be great for me to get a feel on how to do it.<br /> I have an idea that I would like to pm you about, Lyre.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-07T23:07:15-08:00","id":86515,"title":"","content":"Is it too late to join?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1411-wingnut2292","name":"wingnut2292","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1411_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T08:02:27-08:00","id":86765,"title":"","content":"No not at all. I'm finishing writing out the setting specifics and the other story factors, as to give the players a bit of better idea about the chronicle. Pm any character ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T11:34:16-07:00","id":87612,"title":"","content":"I have a couple of ideas. One is a reverse of the original Capt. Marvel, an geriatric but successful businessman with full of regrets and wishing for a second chance to live his life, gets it in the form of be able to transform into a young superheroine! (Just for the extra twist. (^_-) )<br /> <br /> Another idea was a homage to Krypto the Superdog. A bomb squad dod was busy, with 4 calls in a single day. Scientists believe that exposure to the combination of residual chemicals resulting in a dog erupting as a nova.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1411-wingnut2292","name":"wingnut2292","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1411_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T13:29:03-07:00","id":87697,"title":"","content":"I don't think the second character has much room in the chronicle, but feel free to expand the first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T14:00:04-07:00","id":87717,"title":"","content":"i'd be pretty interested, if there's still room","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2479-demented","name":"Demented","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T14:01:43-07:00","id":87719,"title":"","content":"Animals don't erupt as I recall, but I guess you could &quot;genegineer&quot; yourself a superdog with illegal tech. People make vampire Pomeranians an stuff after all... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T15:22:59-07:00","id":87769,"title":"","content":"oh, and i'd lean towards an aberrant character as well, since i've got some experience with the system. i'm seeing if i can track down the other books though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2479-demented","name":"Demented","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T18:45:43-07:00","id":87857,"title":"","content":"Yes it is only humans who erupt. Best bet is probably seeing if you can buy the pdfs. here is still room. I'm realizing this format of game will not really fit on the white-wolf forums and we may need to host it else where.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T20:47:58-07:00","id":87904,"title":"","content":"May I sugggest rpol.net? The site's dice roller is handy, if annoyingly truly random in it's rolls, and the ability to have sub forums is very helpful organizationally.<br /> <br /> Working on statting up my concept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1411-wingnut2292","name":"wingnut2292","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1411_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T02:05:20-07:00","id":89346,"title":"","content":"Is it just the five of us for now, or would there be additional recruiting at whatever place we ultimately host the game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T08:21:53-07:00","id":89495,"title":"","content":"There will likely be addition recruiting. I've got the ground work done, I'm getting ideas from you players. I'll set up a game forum, likely at rpol, sometime this week. I'll probably be MIA the later part of this week into tuesday. I have finals and it is St. Patricks day in Savannah, GA next week, which spells chaos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","us